# What never goes into a build context (and so never into an image). Milestone 7; Milestone 8
# adds test sources and reports (no image needs them) for Dockerfile.node, Dockerfile.nextrs and
# docker/Dockerfile.*, which all use the repository root as their context.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
.git
.github
# Railway IaC authoring files (read by the Railway CLI, never by an image)
.railway
docs
benchmarks/**/results
backups
playwright-report*
test-results
blob-report
tests
**/*.log
.vscode
.idea
# Secrets and local configuration
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
# Local databases and backups (passenger data)
**/data
**/*.db
**/*.db.partial
**/*.db.pre-restore-*
